						<H2>
							<FORM method=post name=frmApply id=frmApply action="app_application.asp">
								<TABLE width="682" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="2" cols="2" border="0">
									<TR>
										<TD align="middle" colSpan="2">
											<P><FONT face="Trebuchet MS" size="2">THIS IS THE CURRENT STATUS AND MINIMUM 
													REQUIREMENTS ON THE FOLLOWING CLASSES AS OF
													4/1/2003
													. IF YOU DON'T MEET THESE REQUIREMENTS WAIT UNTIL YOU DO BEFORE YOU SUBMIT AN 
													APPLICATION.</FONT></P>
											<P>
												<TABLE id="Table1" cellSpacing="1" cellPadding="1" width="100%" border="1">
													<TR>
														<TD width="358"><FONT face="Trebuchet MS" size="2">1) 24+ AA<BR>
																2) 100+ ON ALL RESISTS<BR>
																3) EMP KEY (EXCLUDING INSIGNIA)<BR>
																4) VT KEY (EXCLUDING POWER SOURCE &amp; ORB OF LUCINITE)<BR>
																5) FLAGS-AERIN'DAR(POV DRAGON), GRUMMUS, TERRIS THULE, BEHEMOTH, POS QUEST<BR>
																6) CORRUPTED SHISSAR BANE WEAPONS<BR>
																7) 30+ HOURS OF PLAYTIME EACH WEEK<BR>
																8) GOOD ATTITUDE AND LISTENER</FONT><BR>
														</TD>
														<TD><FONT face="Trebuchet MS" size="2"> BARD...................OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																BEASTLORD...........OPEN 60+/HIGH PRIORITY<BR>
																CLERIC.................OPEN 63+/HIGH PRIORITY<BR>
																DRUID..................OPEN 65/LOW PRIORITY<BR>
																ENCHANTER...........OPEN 65/HIGH PRIORITY<BR>
																MAGICIAN.............OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																MONK..................OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																NECROMANCER........OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																PALADIN...............OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																RANGER................OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																ROGUE.................OPEN 65/LOW PRIORITY<BR>
																SHADOW KNIGHT.....OPEN 65/LOW PRIORITY<BR>
																SHAMAN...............OPEN 65/LOW PRIORITY<BR>
																WARRIOR..............OPEN 65/MEDIUM PRIORITY<BR>
																WIZARD................OPEN 65/HIGH PRIORITY </FONT>
														</TD>
													</TR>
												</TABLE>
											</P>
											<P><FONT face="Trebuchet MS" size="2">PLease feel free to post an application on our website should you meet all of the above requirements. As guild status can change from week to week...our guild priorities also flucuate in terms of needed classes. No Class is closed for application purposes, however, please understand that the posting of an application does not guarentee you a position within Vex.</P>

<P>If a position becomes open that we feel you may fill the need, you will be contacted in game/email by me to discuss the possibility of attending some Vexare raids as a recruit. Please understand that we cannot possibily invite out everyone who applies and often it is a case of being in the right place at the right time.</P> 

<P>Should you be contacted to come out on trial as a recruit....you will continue throughout a 2 week period as a Vexare guest during this assessment period. This means no DKP will be earned for raid attendance. Anytime during that 2 week period you or we may find that Vexare is not a good fit for you and you will be let go to pursue other options. </P>

<P>We thank you for your interest in Vexare and we will be in touch with you, if consideration is being given for you to move to the recruit phase.</P><BR>
													<BR>
													<STRONG>SENSEI DURELL DEATHSTRIKE<BR>
														VEXARE RECRUITER</STRONG></FONT><BR>
												<BR>
											</P>
										</TD>
